title: The Kapp Putsch
subtitle: The Ehrhardt Brigade marches on Berlin.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1920 and month = 3 and kapp_started = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 6
on-arrival: {!
Q.kapp_started = 1;
Q.crisis = 1;
Q.crisis_kapp = 1;
Q.crisis_time = 0;
Q.week = 1;
Q.crisis_name = 'The Kapp Putsch';
Q.crisis_goal = 'Keep the general strike going until the putsch falls, and decide what to demand when it does.';
Q.crisis_momentum = 50;
Q.crisis_momentum_label = 0;
Q.stability -= 15;
Q.army_loyalty -= 15;
Q.freikorps_loyalty -= 20;
Q.e20_lead_ul = (Q.leading_faction == 'ultraleft') ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.levi_chair == 1 && Q.comrade_levi == 1) { RG.arrest('levi', 1, {quiet: true}); }
for (var d of Q.districts) { if (d != 'bavaria') { RG.startStrike(d, true); } }
RG.districtSummary();
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Districts on strike: ' + Q.strike_count + ' of 8';
Q.crisis_line_2 = 'Our voice in the strike: none yet';
Q.crisis_line_3 = 'The Reichswehr: waiting in its barracks';
RG.news('Putsch in Berlin: Kapp proclaims himself Chancellor', 3);
RG.news('General strike: twelve million down tools against the putsch', 3);
!}

= The Kapp Putsch

Before dawn on 13 March the Ehrhardt Marine Brigade marched into Berlin from its camp at Döberitz, with swastikas painted on its helmets. The government had been ordered to disband it under the peace treaty. General von Lüttwitz chose to disband the government instead. The ministers fled to Dresden. "Troops do not fire on troops," General von Seeckt is said to have told Noske. By breakfast a provincial official named Wolfgang Kapp had proclaimed himself Chancellor.

Then Carl Legien's unions, the SPD and the USPD called a general strike. [? if levi_chair = 1 : Paul Levi is in a prison cell. ?] The members of the Zentrale who are still free meet in a back room. They must say today where the party stands.

- @not_a_finger: "The working class will not lift a finger for the democratic republic."
- @join_strike: Join the general strike at once, under our own slogans.
- @to_arms: Call the workers to arms.
- @councils: Call for action committees to take power in the factories.

@not_a_finger
subtitle: A quarrel between two gangs of the bourgeoisie. Our members may not see it that way.
on-arrival: {!
Q.kapp_statement = 1;
Q.e20_kapp_voice = 0;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
Q.worker_support -= 4;
RG.ecci('lenin', -8);
!}

By the afternoon every factory in Berlin has stopped anyway, without us. Our own members are on the picket lines, asking what the Zentrale is playing at.

@join_strike
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Defeat Kapp first, and fight for more inside the strike.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids striking alongside the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.kapp_statement = 2;
Q.e20_kapp_voice = 2;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
Q.uspd_relation += 5;
Q.crisis_line_2 = 'Our voice in the strike: leading';
RG.ecci('lenin', 5);
!}

Our people are on the strike committees from the first hour.

@to_arms
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Ruhr and Central Germany are already arming. The officers will remember who called them out.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids an armed rising.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.kapp_statement = 3;
Q.kapp_armed = 1;
Q.e20_kapp_voice = 1;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
Q.crisis_line_2 = 'Our voice in the strike: heard';
RG.ecci('bukharin', 6);
RG.district('ruhr', {guards: 2});
RG.district('halle', {guards: 1});
!}

We call on the workers to take rifles from the police stations and the civil guards' depots. In the Ruhr they are doing it already.

@councils
subtitle: Neither Kapp nor Ebert, but the councils. Hamburg and Bremen will follow.
view-if: ultraleft_gone = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.kapp_statement = 4;
Q.e20_kapp_voice = 1;
Q.lean_ultraleft += 2;
Q.crisis_line_2 = 'Our voice in the strike: heard';
RG.district('hamburg', {militancy: 6});
RG.district('bremen', {militancy: 6});
!}
